SUMMARY:Bingham Road ReWild Workday (Asheville)
DESCRIPTION:Join ReWild AVL as we break ground on a habitat restoration project at the City of Asheville Water Resources Center on Bingham Road. We’ll continue prepping the area for a native planting in the fall. This is a great opportunity to be involved in the early stages as we transform this concrete desert into habitat for wildlife!  \nREGISTER HERE
