SUMMARY:Native Plants Made Easy (Marvin)
DESCRIPTION:Are you Native Plant curious but don’t know where or how to start? Are you just starting to add native plants to your landscape and want help to focus on the best starter plants? Or are you new to our area and want to learn more about native plants that grow well in the Southern Piedmont? If yes\, then this is the class for you. Join NCWF Habitat Builders Chapter Builders and Wild Ones to learn more about native plants. This free class is in person only and will be held at 10006 Marvin School Road\, Marvin\, NC at the Marvin Village Hall.  \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/native-plants-made-easy-marvin/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/NativePlantsMadeEasy.jpg
