SUMMARY:Pocosin Lakes NWR Workday (Columbia)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Wildlife Habitat Stewards of Northeastern NC Chapter as they bring volunteers together for a workday at Pocosin Lakes National Wildlife Refuge’s headquarters in Columbia! Volunteers will help remove invasive plant species and plant beneficial native plants to enhance wildlife habitat connectivity along the Scuppernong River. All ages are invited to help!  \nREGISTER HERE
