SUMMARY:Guided Flora & Fauna Walk (Fairview)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF ReWild AVL for a guided flora and fauna walk. Nestled in Buncombe County\, Wyldhaven Homestead is a plant sanctuary and nursery dedicated to the restoration\, conservation\, and protection of native plants in the southern Appalachians. \nDuring this fun afternoon\, participants will chat with like minded conservationists\, discuss native plants and conservation initiatives like The Butterfly Highway\, and stroll through teaching gardens\, meadows\, and cove forests while identifying native plants and wildlife along the way. Afterwards\, we’ll keep the party going at Turgua Brewing! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/guided-flora-fauna-walk-fairview/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/florafaunaheader.jpg
END:VEVENT
