SUMMARY:Junior Ranger Day (Albemarle)
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun family activity? Join Uwharrie Wildlife Stewards at Morrow Mountain State Park and work toward earning your Junior Ranger Badge! The day will begin at the boathouse at 2 PM\, where a park ranger will conduct an interview. This is one of the required tasks for the Junior Ranger Program and gives everyone the opportunity to complete it together. \nREGISTER HERE
