SUMMARY:High Country Wild Social! (West Jefferson)
DESCRIPTION:High Country Wild is one of NCWF’s newest Community Wildlife Chapters. The chapter protects\, conserves\, and restores wildlife and habitat in Ashe and Watauga County. The chapter brings the local community together with opportunities to restore habitat\, connect with nature\, and learn about important wildlife and habitat topics in the region. \nJoin us as we get together at the New River Taproom in West Jefferson for a fun evening to celebrate chapter progress and look forward to the future. This is an opportunity to learn more about High Country Wild\, meet NCWF staff and local chapter leaders\, and get involved with conservation at the grassroots level. Bring your ideas\, curiosity\, and maybe a few random wildlife facts. All are welcome!  \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/high-country-wild-social-west-jefferson/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/taproom.jpg
END:VEVENT
